  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:offmenu:entity-reconciliation:1",
  "title": "Pure selected entity reconciliation inputs",
  "description": "Caller-selected authority is independent of proposal. Runtime additionally enforces referential/append-only/qualified-scope/bounded invariants. No data admission or source-rights grant. Input wrapper uses null for absent prior history/registry; Python API defaults them to None. All refs local.",
